        "203681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34235baf6c552c47f1344434",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于中后方时\\n速度稍微提升\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "916fc0c6bec855adfb5d54e088463d212dd1c0f5fadb6b82de9acadad04aa1aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "203682"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c5dd612f172bb0ef304ed01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为憧憬的前辈获胜,兴奋得睡不着\\n稍微不容易发挥能力\\n并变得容易焦急",
      "source_fingerprint": "debcef4f672edc3b501c8e18a211ab18a1813ca94490fdbbdb6992b53b3be2b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "203691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f460b3064acf9d9f94261db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期\n若余力十分充足则向前突进\n<先行·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ee160d94d7e7018e2c7411acb87552ed76a436d439d3ab3c2396438fa49d09a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
